[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-MIGRATE-001
TITLE: load_old_project_config — Parse Legacy Project Configuration
STATEMENT: >>>
Support migration from older agent-meta versions:
  - Old format: JSON or old YAML schema
  - Detect format and version automatically
  - Map old field names to new schema
Return: dict representing old config.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Legacy support enables smooth upgrades between versions.
<<<
VERIFICATION: >>>
- tests/test_migrate.py::test_load_old_project_config_json
- tests/test_migrate.py::test_load_old_project_config_yaml
<<<
