STATUS: Active
PRIORITY: P2
OWNER: @daniel
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: called-by
  VALUE: REQ-MIGRATE-002

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-MIGRATE-002
TITLE: map_old_to_new_schema — Transform Legacy Config
STATEMENT: >>>
Transform old config fields to new schema:
  - old_name → name
  - old_providers_list → ai_providers
  - old_custom_vars → custom_vars
  - old_dod_setting → dod_preset
Warn on unmapped fields.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Schema mapping handles breaking changes across versions.
<<<
VERIFICATION: >>>
- tests/test_migrate.py::test_map_old_to_new_schema_v038
- tests/test_migrate.py::test_map_old_to_new_schema_v039
<<<
TAGS: migrate, schema, transformation
STATUS: Active
PRIORITY: P2
OWNER: @daniel
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: calls
  VALUE: REQ-MIGRATE-001
- TYPE: called-by
