[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-MIGRATE-004
TITLE: migrate_project_config — Orchestrate Full Migration
STATEMENT: >>>
migrate_project_config(old_path, new_path, backup=True):
  1. Load old config
  2. Map to new schema
  3. Validate
  4. Backup old (optional)
  5. Write new config
Return: (success: bool, report: str).
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Orchestration ensures safe, documented config migration.
<<<
VERIFICATION: >>>
- tests/test_migrate.py::test_migrate_project_config_e2e
<<<
