[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-LIFECYCLE-002
TITLE: detect_lifecycle_event — Check Git Event Type
STATEMENT: >>>
Detect git event:
  - on-release: new tag matching vX.Y.Z
  - on-merge: merge commit (parent count = 2)
  - on-version-bump: VERSION or CHANGELOG modified
Return: event_type or None.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Event detection triggers lifecycle automation.
<<<
VERIFICATION: >>>
- tests/test_lifecycle.py::test_detect_lifecycle_event_release
- tests/test_lifecycle.py::test_detect_lifecycle_event_merge
<<<
